Thor RA2
========

Thor RA2 is a fork of RA2 Engine (https://github.com/omarelarab/ra2-engine)
by Omar El Arab, licensed under the Zero-Clause BSD licence (see LICENSE).
Thor RA2's own changes (the command deck, the Android shell, the build
scripts) are released under the same 0BSD licence.

Third-party components keep their own licences; they are listed with their
licence texts in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md:

  - SDL 2.30.9 ............................ zlib licence
  - stb_image_write ....................... MIT (or public domain)
  - doctest (tests only, not shipped) ..... MIT
  - LLVM libc++ (Android NDK) ............. Apache 2.0 with LLVM exceptions
  - Inter, JetBrains Mono fonts ........... SIL Open Font License 1.1

The APK ships LICENSE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the two OFL texts in its
assets.

